identity_details:
Violet appears only where a person is or must act:
• the arches and loops on drafts;
• Approve buttons;
• the asker’s lilac initial;
• people’s stations and stops on metro strips;
• the sidebar’s pending dot.
‘Ask’ and ‘Draft it on the Line screen’ are ink, because they hand work to a machine. This keeps violet inside the colour page’s ≤ 3%.

Radii are concentric:
• the field is 14 with a 6 px inset, so the Ask button is 8;
• the rail is 16;
• the evidence figure is 12;
• the message preview is 8.
Nothing is sharper than 8 px, and nothing is a pill (no chips: suggestions are rows and text links).

